    },
    "The easiest way is to tap Continue with PlayStation on the pairing screen and sign in. Farframe reads your Remote Play Account ID from that sign-in and keeps only the ID. You never need to type it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Am einfachsten: Auf dem Kopplungsbildschirm Mit PlayStation fortfahren und anmelden. Farframe liest die Remote-Play-Account-ID und behält nur die ID. Tippen entfällt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo más fácil es tocar Continuar con PlayStation en la pantalla de vínculo e iniciar sesión. Farframe lee el Account ID de Remote Play y solo guarda el ID. No hace falta escribirlo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le plus simple est de toucher Continuer avec PlayStation à l’association et de vous connecter. Farframe lit l’Account ID Remote Play et ne garde que l’ID. Pas besoin de le saisir."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il modo più semplice è toccare Continua con PlayStation e accedere. Farframe legge l’Account ID di Remote Play e tiene solo l’ID. Non devi digitarlo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "いちばん簡単なのは、登録画面でPlayStationで続けるをタップしてサインインすることです。FarframeはRemote Play Account IDだけを読み取り、保存します。手入力は不要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "가장 쉬운 방법은 연결 화면에서 PlayStation으로 계속을 탭하고 로그인하는 것입니다. Farframe이 Remote Play Account ID만 읽고 저장합니다. 직접 입력할 필요는 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O mais fácil é tocar em Continuar com PlayStation na tela de vínculo e entrar. O Farframe lê o Account ID do Remote Play e guarda só o ID. Você não precisa digitá-lo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最简单的是在配对屏幕点使用 PlayStation 继续并登录。Farframe 只读取并保存 Remote Play Account ID。不必手打。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "最簡單的是在配對畫面點使用 PlayStation 繼續並登入。Farframe 只讀取並儲存 Remote Play Account ID。不必手打。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game keeps running while the headset is off, so you can put it back on and continue. After this long, Farframe ends the session the same way closing the player does: Rest PS5 if the toggle above is on, otherwise Disconnect." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Spiel läuft ohne Headset weiter. Nach dieser Zeit beendet Farframe die Sitzung wie beim Schließen: PS5-Ruhemodus wenn der Schalter oben an ist, sonst Trennen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El juego sigue con el visor quitado; puedes volver a ponértelo. Pasado este tiempo, Farframe cierra la sesión igual que al cerrar el reproductor: reposo de PS5 si el interruptor de arriba está on, si no, desconexión."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le jeu continue casque retiré ; vous pouvez le remettre. Après ce délai, Farframe termine la session comme à la fermeture : repos PS5 si l’option ci-dessus est activée, sinon déconnexion."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il gioco continua a visore tolto; puoi rimetterlo. Dopo questo tempo Farframe chiude la sessione come alla chiusura: riposo PS5 se l’opzione sopra è attiva, altrimenti disconnessione."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "ヘッドセットを外してもゲームは続きます。この時間を過ぎると、Farframeはプレイヤーを閉じたときと同じくセッションを終了します。上のスイッチがオンならPS5レスト、オフなら切断です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "헤드셋을 벗어도 게임은 계속됩니다. 이 시간이 지나면 Farframe이 플레이어를 닫을 때와 같이 세션을 끝냅니다. 위 스위치가 켜져 있으면 PS5 휴식, 아니면 연결 해제입니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O jogo continua com o headset off; você pode colocar de novo. Depois deste tempo, o Farframe encerra a sessão como ao fechar: rest do PS5 se a opção acima estiver ligada, senão desconecta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取下头显后游戏仍在运行，戴上即可继续。超过此时长后，Farframe 会像关闭播放器一样结束会话：上方开关打开则 PS5 休息模式，否则断开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "取下頭戴裝置後遊戲仍在執行，戴上即可繼續。超過此時長後，Farframe 會像關閉播放器一樣結束工作階段：上方開關打開則 PS5 休息模式，否則中斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
