    "Turn the controller off, hold PS and Create until the light flashes, then choose it in Settings, Bluetooth. Pair it with Vision Pro, not the console." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Controller aus, PS und Create halten bis es blinkt, dann in Einstellungen, Bluetooth wählen. Mit Vision Pro koppeln, nicht mit der Konsole."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apaga el mando, mantén PS y Create hasta que parpadee, y elígelo en Ajustes, Bluetooth. Vínculalo con Vision Pro, no con la consola."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Éteignez la manette, maintenez PS et Create jusqu’au clignotement, puis choisissez-la dans Réglages, Bluetooth. Associez-la au Vision Pro, pas à la console."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spegni il controller, tieni PS e Create finché lampeggia, poi sceglilo in Impostazioni, Bluetooth. Associalo al Vision Pro, non alla console."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "コントローラーを切り、点滅するまでPSとCreateを押し、設定、Bluetoothで選びます。本体ではなくVision Proに接続してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "컨트롤러를 끄고, 표시등이 깜빡일 때까지 PS와 Create를 누른 뒤 설정, Bluetooth에서 선택하세요. 본체가 아니라 Vision Pro에 연결합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Desligue o controle, segure PS e Create até piscar e escolha em Ajustes, Bluetooth. Vincule ao Vision Pro, não ao console."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
